node_modules/
dist/
.svelte-kit/

# tools/ is scratch, all of it: one-off probes and screenshot harnesses written to
# answer a single question, where once it is answered nobody runs them again. They
# need a browser binary at a hardcoded path and a running stack, so none of them can
# join `just app-check`, and a reader who found one would have no way to tell whether
# it still passes. Anything durable enough to be worth keeping is worth writing as a
# vitest file next to what it tests, where it runs.
tools/
